# AGENTS.md

Instructions for AI coding agents working in this repository.

**Universal entry:** **`AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md`** (all AI tools). This file adds project specifics.

## Project

- **Name:** {{PROJECT_NAME}}
- **Version file:** {{VERSION_FILE}}
- **Test command:** `run_tests.bat`
- **Audit command:** `run_audit.cmd` → report per `docs/AUDIT.md` (Fix + Improve only)
- **CI build:** `build_ci.bat` with `BUILD_NOPAUSE=1`
- **Product backlog:** `docs/ROADMAP.md` (parked work — not audit Improve)
- **Known limitations:** `docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md` (informational)

## Before long shell commands

Use **agent-hygiene** MCP when available:

1. `agent_hygiene_full_check`
2. After force-kill: `cleanup_orphan_agent_processes` (`dry_run=True` first)

Without MCP: `%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\AgentStarterPack\pack\scripts\cleanup-orphan-processes.ps1`

## Audits

Say **audit**. Agent runs `run_audit.cmd` and follows **`docs/AUDIT.md`**. Report only **Fix** and **Improve**.

Do not use Phase A/B, add-ons menus, or audit overlay rules.

## GUI tests (if applicable)

- Skill **agent-gui-test-hygiene**
- `QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen`
- Full suite: `run_tests.bat` or `run_audit.cmd` (includes tests)

## Builds (agents)

